( F5 T4 U9c: control_mesh_extrude_element 10 -prism12 on a mesh with a
  -quad9: the quad9 needs mid planes {-hex27}, the tria6 still become
  -prism12 on the base and top planes {manual 6.181: "Then either the 12
  node or 18 node prismatic elements will be generated"}; the unused tria6
  mid-plane nodes are deleted. The Professional 02-08-2026 generates
  -prism18 here [DIVERGENCES EXTRUDE-ELEMENT-PRISM12-QUAD9]. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0 0
node 2 0.5 0 0
node 3 1 0 0
node 4 0 0.5 0
node 5 0.5 0.5 0
node 6 0 1 0
node 7 1 0.5 0
node 8 1 1 0
node 9 0.5 1 0
element 1 -tria6 1 2 3 4 5 6
element 2 -tria6 3 7 8 5 9 6
node 10 1.5 0 0
node 11 2 0 0
node 12 1.5 0.5 0
node 13 2 0.5 0
node 14 1.5 1 0
node 15 2 1 0
element 3 -quad9 3 10 11 7 12 13 8 14 15
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.2
group_materi_density 0 0.
control_mesh_extrude 10 0. 2.
control_mesh_extrude_element 10 -prism12
end_data
